## 假資料快速參考

### FreeGame 假資料結構

| 檔案 | sg_state | 用途 |
|------|----------|------|
| FG_TriggerFromMG | 1 (INIT) | MG spin 觸發 FG |
| FG_Spin_N_*.txt | 2 (PROCESS) | FG 每手結果 |
| FG_Spin_End | 4 (END) | FG 最後一手 |
| FG_Recovery | 3 (RECOVERY) | 斷線重連（放 StartGame） |

> ⚠️ 枚舉值以下方「實戰經驗」第 1 點為準：RECOVERY=3、END=4。

### 假資料必要欄位

FG 觸發封包（`FG_TriggerFromMG`）：
```json
{
  "data": {
    "game_state": { "sg_state": 1, "current_sg_id": 1 },
    "sg": {
      "sg_id": 1,
      "sg_state": 1,
      "sg_map": {
        "play_times": 0,
        "total_times": 7,
        "scatter_count": 3,
        "current_phase": 0,
        "reel_heights": [3, 3, 3, 3, 3],
        "result": { "result_wheels": {...} },
        "fake_fever_reels": {...}
      }
    }
  }
}
```

FG 每手封包（`FG_Spin_N`）：
```json
{
  "data": {
    "game_state": { "sg_state": 2, "current_sg_id": 1 },
    "sg": {
      "sg_id": 1,
      "sg_state": 2,
      "sg_map": {
        "play_times": N,
        "total_times": 7,
        "scatter_count": ...,
        "current_phase": ...,
        "result": { "result_wheels": {...}, "bingo": [...] }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

FG 結束封包（`FG_Spin_End`）：
```json
{
  "data": {
    "game_state": { "sg_state": 4, "current_sg_id": 1 },
    "sg": {
      "sg_id": 1,
      "sg_state": 4,
      "sg_map": {
        "play_times": 7,
        "total_times": 7,
